It is a GNOME Shell extension that listens to Movement Stream signals sent by
Solaar over the session D-Bus. Its preferences window runs the installed Solaar
to discover buttons and change Solaar's Key/Button Diversion setting. Solaar is
not bundled and is licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later.

Parts of the GNOME gesture code are carried over from Workspace Glide
(https://github.com/Cimplex/WorkspaceGlide) by the same author.
